  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut the sweet potato into bite-sized chunks. Place the sweet potato on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat, then bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60ee5d0c3c540d2902272318/step-002a6da0.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the sweet potato is roasting, finely chop the brown onion. Finely chop the garlic. Pick and thinly slice the sage leaves. Roughly chop the pecans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60ee5d0c3c540d2902272318/step-c8a3d8f2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook the onion, stirring, until softened, 5 minutes. Add the garlic and sage and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Add the arborio rice and stir to coat. Add the water and vegetable stock pot and bring to the boil. Remove from the heat and transfer the risotto to a medium baking dish. Cover tightly with foil and bake in the oven until the liquid is absorbed and the rice is 'al dente', 30-35 minutes.\n• TIP: 'Al dente' rice is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60ee5d0c3c540d2902272318/step-4e6e47ed.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the risotto has 15 minutes cook time left, roughly chop the silverbeet. Return the frying pan to a high heat with a drizzle of olive oil and 1/2 the butter. Add the sliced mushrooms and cook, stirring, until well browned, 5-6 minutes.\n• Add the silverbeet and cook until wilted, 1-2 minutes. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60ee5d0c3c540d2902272318/step-bb91ea2e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the risotto from the oven. Add a generous amount of the grated Parmesan cheese (reserve some for the garnish!) and remaining butter. Stir through a splash of water to loosen the risotto if needed. Gently stir in the roasted sweet potato, mushrooms and silverbeet. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60ee5d0c3c540d2902272318/step-37a7039c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide the roasted sweet potato risotto between bowls. Serve sprinkled with the pecans and reserved Parmesan cheese.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60ee5d0c3c540d2902272318/step-62f1a4f6.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
